WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.644
Step 1. Open the Immunizations tab of the encounter.

1.2
00:00:03.644 --> 00:00:06.842
Care has no way to delete an immunization record.

1.3
00:00:06.842 --> 00:00:12.107
You correct it, or mark it entered in error, in the Administered section.

2.1
00:00:12.107 --> 00:00:15.139
Step 2. Open the Edit immunization sheet.

2.2
00:00:15.139 --> 00:00:18.600
Find the record under Administered and select Edit.

2.3
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.986
Care saves the correction only while the encounter of that dose is open.

3.1
00:00:23.986 --> 00:00:28.633
Step 3. Correct the values. The sheet starts with the saved values.

3.2
00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:36.628
Change the ones that are wrong, here the site. You cannot change the vaccine.

4.1
00:00:36.628 --> 00:00:39.747
Step 4. Save the correction. Select Save.

4.2
00:00:39.747 --> 00:00:43.246
Care shows Immunization updated, closes the sheet,

4.3
00:00:43.246 --> 00:00:47.665
and the Administered section shows the corrected record.
